flowchart TB
    accTitle: Certificate-bound protocol identity
    accDescr: The protocol NodeId is derived from SHA-256 of the certificate public key SPKI, truncated to sixteen bytes and encoded as lowercase hexadecimal.
    Cert["Peer certificate<br/>DER encoding"]
    SPKI["Extract public-key SPKI<br/>Hash its DER bytes with SHA-256"]
    Truncate["Take first 16 hash bytes<br/>128-bit identity"]
    Node["Encode lowercase hexadecimal<br/>32-character protocol NodeId"]
    Verify["Compare with claimed NodeId during admission"]
    Cert --> SPKI
    SPKI --> Truncate
    Truncate --> Node
    Node --> Verify
